    "en": [
      "The postcard features a sepia-toned photograph of a European boulevard lined with impressive multi-story classical buildings. In the top left corner, there is a green postage stamp from Greece (ELLAS). Decorative borders frame the image, and handwritten text in Greek appears at the bottom and right side. The printed text at the bottom reads 'CORFOU - Boulevard Georges.'"
